error[SC0411]: `*u` may be read before anything was assigned to it
   ╭─[ a_pointer_read_out_of_a_block_that_names_an_unwritten_local_is_doubted_where_read_through.c:8:10 ]
   │
 8 │     int *r = *u;
   │          ───┬──  
   │             ╰──── read here
───╯
  = note: C17 6.2.4 p6 and 6.7.9 p10 leave a local indeterminate until something writes it, and Annex J.2 lists using that value as undefined
  = note: this check belongs to safety level 1
  = note: this could not be proven, and unproven results are errors in this compilation
  = help: assign it on every path before it is read
